ege-entry, user-copy, state-ownership, and single-CPU exclusion findings remain resolved. cpu.rs is still large, so the extraction is a concrete first ratchet rather than a claim that decomposition is finished.\n\nThe privately reported item remains intentionally excluded from this public record. I am leaving the issue and PR open for review.", "author_association": "OWNER", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/comments/6540049147/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/comments/6540094116", "html_url": "https://github.com/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/5#issuecomment-6540094116", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/5", "id": 6540094116, "node_id": "IC_kwDOVESuUM8AAAABhdHqpA", "user": {"login": "gmkurtzer", "id": 13984965, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTg0OTY1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13984965?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer", "html_url": "https://github.com/gmkurtzer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-10-31T06:29:12Z", "updated_at"